window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Ours is but to do or die.</b> </p> <p>A Kate Hamilton Two-Hour Mystery, Thriller &amp; Suspense Short Reads </p> <p>Science teacher Kate Hamilton is moving to Washington DC, to be closer to her disabled SEAL husband. </p> <p>Her marriage is held together by a thread. Her baby is due very soon...too soon. </p> <p>Kate begins the new semester at William Howard Taft High teaching their new criminal justice classes with her neighbor Detective Dave Murphy. </p> <p>Her student finds an injured vet. Kate delivers first aid. </p> <p>An object passed from victim to good Samaritan, a class of teens who don’t like to be told “no”, this all seems too familiar to Kate. </p> <p>Good intentions don’t always lead to good outcomes. </p> <p>Join Kate as she tries to stay one step ahead of the killer in this urban cozy mystery.</p>"; 
